# Flux reconciliation bundle

These Flux resources are an optional reconciliation bundle for `{{ project_name }}`.
An existing Flux controller and reconciliation root must include these files
before Flux will manage the application. The `GitRepository` URL points to this
project's Git repository, and its `main` branch is reconciled from
`./kubernetes/base`.

This bundle does not install or bootstrap Flux, configure cluster credentials,
or apply resources. The application Kustomization uses `prune: false`, so Flux
will not delete resources removed from the source manifests.
